description: Domain-core package conventions for packages/core
globs: packages/core/src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# packages/core

- Keep the package pure domain logic (parse, format, repair, validate, transform, history, path). No React.
- Prefer `I*` interfaces with concrete adapters (`JsonParser`, `SchemaValidator`, `HistoryStack`, etc.).
- Document exported types, interfaces, and classes with JSDoc; document public properties when they add meaning.
- Follow `.agents/skills/jsdoc-typescript-docs` and `.agents/skills/solid-typescript-design`.
- Colocate unit tests as `*.test.ts` next to the module under test.
